## Class Structure

```text
WarCardGame
│
├── Main.java
│
├── Game.java
│   ├── Player player1
│   ├── Player player2
│   ├── Deck deck
│   └── int roundNumber
│
├── Player.java
│   ├── String name
│   └── Queue<Card> hand
│
├── Deck.java
│   └── ArrayList<Card> cards
│
└── Card.java
    ├── int value
    └── String suit
```

---

## Main Classes

### Card

Represents one playing card.

Example cards:

```text
Ace of Spades
10 of Hearts
Queen of Clubs
```

Responsibilities:

```text
- Store card value
- Store card suit
- Display the card
- Allow card values to be compared
```

Suggested values:

```text
2  = Two
3  = Three
4  = Four
5  = Five
6  = Six
7  = Seven
8  = Eight
9  = Nine
10 = Ten
11 = Jack
12 = Queen
13 = King
14 = Ace
```

---

### Deck

Represents the full deck of 52 cards.

Responsibilities:

```text
- Create all 52 cards
- Store the cards before dealing
- Shuffle the deck
- Allow cards to be drawn
- Deal cards to players
```

---

### Player

Represents each player.

Each player has a queue of cards.

A queue is useful because in War:

```text
- Cards are drawn from the front
- Won cards are added to the back
```

Responsibilities:

```text
- Store player name
- Store player's hand
- Draw top card
- Receive won cards
- Check how many cards the player has
- Check if the player still has cards
```

---

### Game

Controls the whole game.

Responsibilities:

```text
- Create the players
- Create the deck
- Shuffle the deck
- Deal cards
- Run each round
- Compare cards
- Handle war
- Check if the game is over
- Print the winner
```

---

## Game Flow

```text
┌─────────────┐
│ Start Game  │
└──────┬──────┘
       │
       ▼
┌─────────────┐
│ Create Deck │
└──────┬──────┘
       │
       ▼
┌─────────────┐
│ Shuffle Deck│
└──────┬──────┘
       │
       ▼
┌────────────────┐
│ Create Players │
└──────┬─────────┘
       │
       ▼
┌─────────────┐
│ Deal Cards  │
└──────┬──────┘
       │
       ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│ Both players have   │
│ cards left?         │
└──────┬──────────────┘
       │
       │ Yes
       ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│ Player 1 draws card │
└──────┬──────────────┘
       │
       ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│ Player 2 draws card │
└──────┬──────────────┘
       │
       ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│ Compare card values │
└──────┬──────────────┘
       │
       ├── Player 1 higher ───► Player 1 gets pile
       │
       ├── Player 2 higher ───► Player 2 gets pile
       │
       └── Same value ────────► WAR!
       │
       ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│ Next round          │
└──────┬──────────────┘
       │
       ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│ Someone has no cards│
└──────┬──────────────┘
       │
       ▼
┌─────────────┐
│ Print Winner│
└─────────────┘
```

---

## Round Logic

```text
┌────────────────────────┐
│      playRound()       │
└───────────┬────────────┘
            │
            ▼
┌────────────────────────┐
│ p1Card = player1.draw  │
│ p2Card = player2.draw  │
└───────────┬────────────┘
            │
            ▼
┌────────────────────────┐
│ Add both cards to pile │
└───────────┬────────────┘
            │
            ▼
┌────────────────────────┐
│ Compare p1Card/p2Card  │
└───────────┬────────────┘
            │
 ┌──────────┼───────────┐
 │          │           │
 ▼          ▼           ▼
P1 wins   P2 wins      Equal
 │          │           │
 ▼          ▼           ▼
P1 gets   P2 gets     handleWar()
pile      pile
```

---

## War Logic

When both players draw cards of the same value, war begins.

```text
┌────────────────────────────┐
│         handleWar()        │
└─────────────┬──────────────┘
              │
              ▼
┌────────────────────────────┐
│ Check both players have    │
│ enough cards               │
└─────────────┬──────────────┘
              │
      ┌───────┴────────┐
      │                │
      ▼                ▼
Not enough cards     Enough cards
      │                │
      ▼                ▼
Other player wins   Each player places
remaining pile      3 cards face down
                       │
                       ▼
                  Each player flips
                  1 war card
                       │
                       ▼
                  Compare war cards
                       │
          ┌────────────┼────────────┐
          ▼            ▼            ▼
       P1 wins      P2 wins       Tie again
          │            │            │
          ▼            ▼            ▼
       P1 gets      P2 gets     Repeat war
       full pile    full pile
```

